    "doc_text": "AFP_ENG_20051203.0375\n\nBUENOS AIRES, Dec 3 , 2005\n\nThree-try Samoa see off Pumas\n\n\n\n\nSamoa ran in three tries to record an impressive 28-12 win against Argentina in a one-off rugby union Test here on Saturday.\n\nPaul Tupai (10), Semo Sititi (14) and Sailosi Tagicakibau (57) all scored tries with Roger Warren kicking two conversions, two penalties as well as a drop goal.\n\nJuan Fernandez Lobbe (four) and Horacio Agulla (24) were Argentina's try scorers with Juan Fernandez Miranda adding one converison for the Pumas.",
